  abstact     = {An unconventional numerical method for solving a restrictive and yet often-encountered class of ordinary differential equations is proposed. The method has a crucial, what we call reflexive, property and requires solving one linear system per time-step, but is second-order accurate. A systematical and easily implementable scheme is proposed to enhance the computational efficiency of such methods whenever needed. Applications are reported on how the idea can be applied to solve the Korteweg-de Vries Equation discretized in space.},
